  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/Traben-0/stuck_arrows_for_all/blob/master/common/src/main/resources/icon.png?raw=true\" width=\"150\"><br></p>\n<h1>Подушка для булавок сущностей</h1>\n<hr>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252frURmwrzUcz\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/vU8pcbf.png\" alt=\"Discord\"></a> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/yZzzW4Q.pngg\" alt=\"-\"> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/entity-pin-cushions\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/rpoyjVG.png\" alt=\"CurseForge\"></a> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/VgKekoJ.png\" alt=\"-\"> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fentity-pin-cushions\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/7fioiRx.png\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/tiNmDIH.png\" alt=\"-\"> <a href=\"https://github.com/Traben-0/stuck_arrows_for_all\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/EYNx6oL.png\" alt=\"GitHub\"></a> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/yar5K6v.png\" alt=\"-\"> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252ftraben\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/xdhWKwC.png\" alt=\"Ko-fi\"></a></p>\n<hr>\n<h1>Описание</h1>\n<p>Теперь стрелы (и жала пчёл) могут застревать не только в игроках, но и в большинстве других мобов.</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/5c94a0ac8e69905ead32ae0e96618f9d3eadf58d.png\" alt=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/5c94a0ac8e69905ead32ae0e96618f9d3eadf58d.png\"></p>\n<hr>\n<h1>Нужна помощь или есть вопросы?</h1>\n<p>Вы можете связаться со мной в моём <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252frURmwrzUcz\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord</a> (<em>предпочтительно</em>) или создать обращение на <a href=\"https://github.com/Traben-0/stuck_arrows_for_all\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub</a>.</p>\n<hr>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252frURmwrzUcz\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/vU8pcbf.png\" alt=\"Discord\"></a> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/yZzzW4Q.pngg\" alt=\"-\"> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/entity-pin-cushions\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/rpoyjVG.png\" alt=\"CurseForge\"></a> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/VgKekoJ.png\" alt=\"-\"> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fentity-pin-cushions\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/7fioiRx.png\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/tiNmDIH.png\" alt=\"-\"> <a href=\"https://github.com/Traben-0/stuck_arrows_for_all\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/EYNx6oL.png\" alt=\"GitHub\"></a> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/yar5K6v.png\" alt=\"-\"> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252ftraben\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/xdhWKwC.png\" alt=\"Ko-fi\"></a></p>\n<hr>\n<h2>Специальное предложение от хостинг-партнёра</h2>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbilling.kinetichosting.com%252faff.php%253faff%253d641\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/BVzZfTc1/images/bfb592538f8206a6a2d72d19c90714bea91b0e07.png\" alt=\"изображение\"></a></p>",
